<view class="page">
 <view class="eyebrow">SUDOKU · 每一步都有依据</view><view class="title">不靠猜，
看懂数独。</view><view class="subtitle">从一对候选数，到你的第一个 Wing。</view>
 <view class="card progress"><view><view class="section-title">你的研习进度</view><view class="muted">慢慢来，理解比速度重要</view></view><view class="count">{{completed}}<text> / {{courses.length}}</text></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view>
 <view class="row heading"><view class="section-title">技巧课程</view><text class="muted">按顺序学，也能直接选</text></view>
 <button wx:for="{{courses}}" wx:key="id" class="course card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openCourse"><view class="course-number">{{item.number}}</view><view class="course-info"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.subtitle}}</view><text class="badge">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><text class="chevron">›</text></button>
 <view class="card foundation"><view class="section-title">开始之前，记住两件事</view><view class="help">候选数是格子仍可能填写的数字，并非确定答案。
两个格子在同一行、同一列或同一宫，就能互相“看到”。</view></view>
 <view class="footnote">离线可用 · 进度仅保存在当前设备</view>
</view>
